# Windows script files MUST keep CRLF line endings. cmd.exe mis-parses an
# LF-only .bat — especially combined with `chcp 65001` and non-ASCII (Cyrillic)
# text — which silently breaks the launchers (ЗАПУСК.bat etc.). Forcing CRLF
# on checkout prevents that class of failure regardless of core.autocrlf.
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
